@startuml
title Sequence - UC-01 Quản lý tài khoản & đăng ký dịch vụ
actor "Sinh viên App" as StudentApp
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "User & Enrollment Service" as UserSvc
database "DB" as DB
participant "Notification Service" as Notif

== Đăng nhập (include UC-16) ==
StudentApp -> API : Login / OAuth2 code
API -> Auth : Exchange code -> token
Auth --> API : id/access token
API --> StudentApp : session established

== Xem & cập nhật thông tin ==
StudentApp -> API : GET /me, /enrollments
API -> UserSvc : fetch profile/enrollments
UserSvc -> DB : select user/enrollment
DB --> UserSvc : data
UserSvc --> API : data
API --> StudentApp : render form

StudentApp -> API : PUT /enrollments {address,schedule,status}
API -> UserSvc : validate & update
UserSvc -> DB : upsert enrollment
DB --> UserSvc : ok
UserSvc --> API : updated
API -> Notif : push confirmation (optional)
API --> StudentApp : success
@enduml